        --wait[=true|false]     Wait for VMs to reach Running (default: false)
        --wait-ssh[=true|false] After Running, probe guest SSH port via virtctl
                                | | | port-forward + nc (implies --wait).
                                | | | Fails the run if any VM is not up within
                                | | | ${SSH_READY_TIMEOUT}s (default: false)
        --containerdisk[=IMAGE] Use a container disk image instead of PVC-backed
