                                | | | Default image:
                                | | | quay.io/containerdisks/fedora:latest
        --cloudinit=FILE        Inject cloud-init user-data from FILE
                                into each VM (e.g. workload/cloudinit-stress-ng-workload.yaml)
        --env KEY=VAL           Set env in guest (repeatable; written to /etc/default/vstorm-guest-env).
                                | | | RESULT_SERVER_URL defaults to the lab collector
                                | | | (${DEFAULT_RESULT_SERVER_URL}); override or set
                                | | | RESULT_SERVER_URL= (empty) to disable POSTs.
